    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The story jumps back to Sapporo in 1980. Instead of making door-to-door sales calls, Toru Muranishi is killing time inside a noisy coffeehouse arcade. When schoolboys start shouting over a tabletop video game, Muranishi snaps at them. Listen to the rough, casual speech first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "いつまでやってんだ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "もう少しでハイスコアだったのに！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "お前、どこだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "北高だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "そっちこそどこだ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "西中だ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "うるさいな、外でやれ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "外ではゲームできないだろう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "こっちはまだ終わっていない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "痛い！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "行くぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ここは札幌の喫茶店だぞ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Teenagers arguing over an arcade machine drop almost every polite ending. Let's unpack what they are shouting.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "いつまでやってんだ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How long are you going to keep playing!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "もう少しでハイスコアだったのに！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I almost had the high score!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "お前、どこだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where are you from?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "北高だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kita High.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "そっちこそどこだ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where are you from yourself!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "うるさいな、外でやれ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Shut up, take it outside!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "外ではゲームできないだろう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We cannot play the game outside, obviously.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "こっちはまだ終わっていない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not finished over here yet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "痛い！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ouch!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "行くぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
